% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/ai_act/conformity_marking_registration. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% The register of this order lists no keys: the statutory figures (the days
% 2 December 2027, 2 August 2028, 2 August 2030 and 31 December 2030 and the
% ten-year keeping period) are value facts of the determination slice
% conformity_marking_registration.clausal, and their wording is recorded in
% citations.clausal (eu_reg_2024_1689_art_113_c_i, eu_reg_2024_1689_art_113_c_ii,
% eu_reg_2024_1689_art_111_2, eu_reg_2024_1689_art_111_1, eu_reg_2024_1689_art_47_1).
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
